error[NK2302]: `P.pick` implements a trait method that hands back views of `a` only, but this hands back a view of `b`, which it takes by value.
   --> tests/an_impl_handing_back_an_owned_parameter_is_refused_once.nika:37:9
    |
 37 |         return b
    |         ^^^^^^^^
    |
    = note: The trait's result says `from a`, so `b` is not lent: it is moved into `P.pick` and ends with it, and a view of it can't outlive the call (ADR-views-3 D14).
    = help: Hand back a view of what the trait names, or write `from a | b` on the trait's result.
